WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:00.893
- All right, everybody.

00:00:00.893 --> 00:00:03.270
Let's wrap up this hour with
something simply charming

00:00:03.270 --> 00:00:04.620
from the pages of social media.

00:00:04.620 --> 00:00:05.719
This is what I'm liking.

00:00:05.719 --> 00:00:08.670
(rock music)

00:00:08.670 --> 00:00:11.250
Most people say dogs
are man's best friend,

00:00:11.250 --> 00:00:12.750
but for one Los Angeles man,

00:00:12.750 --> 00:00:15.210
his best friend is a wild squirrel

00:00:15.210 --> 00:00:17.610
that he named Richard, 'cause why not?

00:00:17.610 --> 00:00:20.097
And Richard's now living
quite the lavish life

00:00:20.097 --> 00:00:22.050
as you'll notice.

00:00:22.050 --> 00:00:24.330
In fact, he's got his very own house

00:00:24.330 --> 00:00:27.090
complete with a fountain,
yard, white picket fence,

00:00:27.090 --> 00:00:28.620
and a working television inside.

00:00:28.620 --> 00:00:30.990
So he's beating some humans right now.

00:00:30.990 --> 00:00:33.390
Richard's become a social media sensation

00:00:33.390 --> 00:00:36.330
with 250,000 followers on Instagram

00:00:36.330 --> 00:00:38.430
and we have his caretaker on the line now

00:00:38.430 --> 00:00:40.440
watching on NBC 4 Los Angeles.

00:00:40.440 --> 00:00:42.426
Everybody say hi to Derrick.

00:00:42.426 --> 00:00:43.259
(crowd cheering)

00:00:43.259 --> 00:00:44.092
What's up Derrick?

00:00:44.092 --> 00:00:45.541
- Hey Kelly.

00:00:45.541 --> 00:00:46.374
- Oh my God.

00:00:46.374 --> 00:00:48.300
I want one of those shirts.

00:00:48.300 --> 00:00:50.040
That's amazing.
- Listen,

00:00:50.040 --> 00:00:51.240
I'm gonna send you one.
- So tell us how you came

00:00:51.240 --> 00:00:52.350
like Richard came into your life.

00:00:52.350 --> 00:00:53.610
How did this happen?

00:00:53.610 --> 00:00:57.210
- So about a year and a half ago, Richard,

00:00:57.210 --> 00:00:58.980
he was on my fence, okay.

00:00:58.980 --> 00:01:01.140
And I looked at him and I was like, hmm.

00:01:01.140 --> 00:01:03.360
I looked at him, I said,
"Hey, are you hungry?"

00:01:03.360 --> 00:01:05.760
And he stopped, he looked at
me and I was like, "All right,

00:01:05.760 --> 00:01:06.690
lemme go get you some food.

00:01:06.690 --> 00:01:07.680
I'll be right back."

00:01:07.680 --> 00:01:09.300
I went and grabbed him some peanuts

00:01:09.300 --> 00:01:12.150
and he was in that same exact
that spot four minutes later.

00:01:12.150 --> 00:01:13.620
That's how long it took me.

00:01:13.620 --> 00:01:16.713
And from there we just
started this relationship.

00:01:17.670 --> 00:01:20.610
And then, you know, he came
around every single day

00:01:20.610 --> 00:01:23.280
and I was like I might as
well build you a house.

00:01:23.280 --> 00:01:24.390
It only sounds right.

00:01:24.390 --> 00:01:25.988
We're basically family at this point.

00:01:25.988 --> 00:01:27.180
(Kelly laughs)

00:01:27.180 --> 00:01:28.350
- I love this so much.

00:01:28.350 --> 00:01:30.300
So you also decorate the house

00:01:30.300 --> 00:01:32.075
to go with different seasons, right?

00:01:32.075 --> 00:01:33.616
- Absolutely.

00:01:33.616 --> 00:01:37.277
So, you know, just like
anybody else's house.

00:01:37.277 --> 00:01:38.110
- [Kelly] I love it.

00:01:38.110 --> 00:01:40.860
- When the seasons change,
the same things should happen

00:01:40.860 --> 00:01:42.990
with Richard's house, it only made sense.

00:01:42.990 --> 00:01:46.980
So we have fall, we have,
you know, Halloween.

00:01:46.980 --> 00:01:48.450
I made it real spooky.

00:01:48.450 --> 00:01:51.120
You know, Christmas is
coming up, so it's only right

00:01:51.120 --> 00:01:54.420
that we deck the halls
with lots of jolly, okay.

00:01:54.420 --> 00:01:59.122
Michaels, the craft store,
even sent some things.

00:01:59.122 --> 00:02:02.070
- Oh my gosh, Derrick, I love you so much.

00:02:02.070 --> 00:02:03.330
I love Richard even more.

00:02:03.330 --> 00:02:04.163
That's so cool.

00:02:04.163 --> 00:02:06.810
Like what you created is so fun, so cute.

00:02:06.810 --> 00:02:08.610
Thank you so much for sharing with us

00:02:08.610 --> 00:02:10.290
and making us all smile.

00:02:10.290 --> 00:02:11.927
I'm liking your post now.

00:02:11.927 --> 00:02:13.236
(crowd cheering)

00:02:13.236 --> 00:02:14.100
And that's not all.

00:02:14.100 --> 00:02:16.860
Our season long partner
Pilot Pen, makers of G2

00:02:16.860 --> 00:02:18.390
the go-to pen of The Kelly Clarkson Show

00:02:18.390 --> 00:02:21.510
want to honor truly unstoppable
people just like you.

00:02:21.510 --> 00:02:22.980
So they're gonna give you $1,000.

00:02:22.980 --> 00:02:23.913
How's that sound?

00:02:23.913 --> 00:02:25.840
(crowd cheering)

00:02:25.840 --> 00:02:29.535
- Hey, listen, I ain't never
gonna turn down no money.

00:02:29.535 --> 00:02:30.821
Thank you so much.

00:02:30.821 --> 00:02:33.035
(Kelly laughing)

00:02:33.035 --> 00:02:33.868
- Oh my God.

00:02:33.868 --> 00:02:34.980
I love you so much, Derrick.

00:02:34.980 --> 00:02:37.226
Have such a great day.

00:02:37.226 --> 00:02:39.540
A big thank you to all our guests today,

00:02:39.540 --> 00:02:42.780
Chloe Grace Moretz, Matt
Rogers, Martin Schwartz,

00:02:42.780 --> 00:02:46.470
Davine Kelsey, P1 Harmony,
Ky Reed, Tommy Clark

00:02:46.470 --> 00:02:48.820
and all our friends at WBAL TV 11.

00:02:48.820 --> 00:02:49.732
Y'all have a great day

00:02:49.732 --> 00:02:51.482
and if it's not, try and change it.

